    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p40-q17-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Find the radius of the sector of perimeter 4 that has maximal area. (Assume the sector does not comprise the entire circle.)",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$r=1$.\n\nExpress the area as a quadratic in $r$; its maximum occurs midway between its zeros.",
          "worked": "Let $\\theta$ be the central angle in radians.\n$$\\begin{align*}2r+r\\theta&=4\\\\r\\theta&=4-2r\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}A&=\\frac12r^2\\theta\\\\A&=\\frac12r(4-2r)\\\\A&=-r(r-2)\\end{align*}$$\nThis quadratic opens downwards and has zeros at $r=0$ and $r=2$. Its maximum occurs halfway between them, at $r=1$. Here $\\theta=2<2\\pi$, so the sector is not the entire circle.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "p40-q17-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Find the radius of the sector of area 16 that has minimal perimeter. (Assume the sector does not comprise the entire circle.)",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$r=4$.\n\nUse AM–GM on $P=2r+\\frac{32}{r}$; equality occurs when $2r=\\frac{32}{r}$.",
          "worked": "Let $\\theta$ be the central angle in radians.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac12r^2\\theta&=16\\\\\\theta&=\\frac{32}{r^2}\\end{align*}$$\nBy the AM–GM inequality,\n$$\\begin{align*}P&=2r+r\\theta\\\\P&=2r+\\frac{32}{r}\\\\P&\\ge 2\\sqrt{(2r)\\left(\\frac{32}{r}\\right)}\\\\P&\\ge16.\\end{align*}$$\nEquality occurs when the two positive terms are equal:\n$$\\begin{align*}2r&=\\frac{32}{r}\\\\r^2&=16\\\\r&=4.\\end{align*}$$\nThus the minimum perimeter occurs at $r=4$. Here $\\theta=2<2\\pi$, so the sector is not the entire circle.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 75
      }
    ]
  },
